---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Team — Kineti"
  description="One-time setup to wire ship-check and spend cap on your repos."
>
  <section class="border-b border-line">
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16">
      <h1 class="max-w-3xl text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-4xl">Team setup</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">We wire <code class="text-accent">ship-check</code> on your default branch and a spend cap. One-time setup.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-line">
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16">
      <div class="max-w-2xl border border-accent bg-surface p-6">
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg">Email: <a href="mailto:hello@getkineti.com?subject=Team%20setup%20—%20%245K&body=GitHub/GitLab%20org:%0AHow%20many%20repos:%0AWho%20pays%20the%20model%20bill:" class="font-bold text-accent hover:underline">hello@getkineti.com</a></p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Include: GitHub/GitLab org, how many repos, who pays the model bill.</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">By emailing, you agree to our <a href="/legal/privacy" class="text-accent hover:underline">Privacy</a> · <a href="/legal/terms" class="text-accent hover:underline">Terms</a></p>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">Hosted gateway + dashboard is waitlist only — see <a href="/pricing" class="text-accent hover:underline">Pricing</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
